  "skip_reason": "Layer-A canonical drive of `fv3_vorticity_cellmean` requires ESS `discretize` to dispatch a cubed_sphere multi-axis stencil whose four rows alternate between u_edge (axis=ξ) and v_edge (axis=η) selectors, and to resolve the per-cell metric bindings (`dx` at UEdge, `dy` at VEdge, `area` at CellCenter) that appear in the row coefficients. Both pieces sit behind the same ESS extension that holds `covariant_laplacian_cubed_sphere` and `transport_2d` Layer-A back today (see audit dsc-ztvz / F7). Once the cubed_sphere multi-axis selector + per-cell metric-binding dispatch lands, this stub can be replaced by a hand-pinned canonical contract that pins the closed circulation Γ = v_d[i,j]·dy[i,j] + u_d[i+1,j]·dx[i+1,j] − v_d[i,j+1]·dy[i,j+1] − u_d[i,j]·dx[i,j] divided by `area` against the imperative reference on a small cN cubed sphere.",
